  "sections": {
    "pf-c0bfe47e": {
      "type": "pf-c0bfe47e",
      "settings": {
        "pf_ae5a92da_value": "We are committed to delighting each customer of ThePhotoStick. We are so confident you will love it, that we offer a no-risk 30-Day Money Back Guarantee, starting at the day of delivery.\n<br><br>Try out our full line of ThePhotoStick products, with no risk! If you have any issues and are not completely satisfied with your purchase for whatever reason, simply contact returns@thephotostick.com or visit our Live Chat support at thephotostick.com.",
        "pf_a0762496_value": "Almost all major Android, iPhone, and iPad devices! Supported Android devices: Compatible with all Samsung, LG, Motorola, and HTC phones running Android OS 4.4 or newer made in the last 3 years. Phones must be OTG compatible. A FREE adapter is included that ensures compatibility with Micro-USB and USB-C devices. Supported iOS devices: Compatible with all iPhones, iPads, and iPod Touches that have a Lightning Port. Requires iOS 9.0 or later.\r\r",
        "pf_13cb1ffd_value": "<a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/about-us\" target=\"_blank\">About Us</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/support\" target=\"_blank\">&nbsp;Contact Us</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/policies/terms-of-service\" target=\"_blank\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\">Privacy Policy</a>",
        "pf_7261e3ea_value": "By simply plugging in ThePhotoStick® Mobile to your computer, you can easily transfer all the photos and videos off the device. It’s compatible with nearly all modern computers using Windows and Mac Operating Systems:<br><br>Windows:\nWindows XP, Windows Vista, Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 8.1, and Windows 10.\n<br><br>Mac:\nMac OS X Version 10.6 and later.",
        "pf_399bb47f_value": "I got all my pictures, screenshots and downloads off my phone, tablet and laptop. What a relief. I have had several phones die over the years and so much info was on them. I don't trust drop box or just saving photos on a device, google took ALL of mine and I have no idea where they are. This photo stick is worth every penny.",
        "pf_9530ecda_value": "Don't waste hours of your time trying to find, organize, and backup all your photos and videos.  Let the ThePhotoStick Mobile do the work for you with one simple click.<br><br>Just Click GO.  No lost hours. No missed photos. No Cloud fees.  Do it yourself with ThePhotoStick Mobile.",
        "pf_49847546_value": "It’s as easy as 1,2,3!<br><br>1. Download and Launch the FREE “ThePhotoStick® Mobile” App<br>2. Plug in the device<br>3. Click “Backup Now”<br><br>(optional) Plug into your computer to get the photos and videos off your device!",
        "pf_dae84265_value": "This SO easy to work with. Simply pug it in, load the small app, and click. Sit back have a coffee or two. (If you are picture hoarder like me a short nap is good) I don't mean to imply it is slow I had a lot of pics.",
        "pf_1a1535bb_value": "Love it love it love it One of the best things I have ever bought to put pictures on I have almost 4000 pictures on in and still have Room to add more easy to work easy to use. Such a great thing to have.",
        "pf_874e03c6_value": "Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people plug ThePhotoStick® Mobile in weekly and do a quick and easy backup to make sure they are continually protecting their memories.\n\n",
        "pf_ae14468a_value": "We ship orders out FAST, but we can’t control carrier transit times. Due to COVID-19, orders are taking up to 10-20 days to be delivered depending on the country.\n",
        "pf_6284446b_value": "ThePhotoStick® Mobile is a small device that instantly backs up your priceless memories WITHOUT the frustration of searching and organizing them yourself!\r",
        "pf_fe3687e8_value": "Never worry about losing files in the cloud or to unknown circumstances like water damage again. ThePhotoStick Mobile keeps your photos and videos safe.",
        "pf_b177882f_value": "It's easy to use and it searched my computer for pictures and videos. This is so worth getting. It's 128gb and it also has a cover.",
        "pf_7222fda2_value": "Depending on your country, it is possible that you will be charged one or more of these fees when you receive your order.\n",
        "pf_70115654_value": "Very easy to use just plug in and that is all your photos organized on the device with organizing tools",
        "pf_a850d2be_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(1, 164, 239); font-weight: 700;\">✓&nbsp;</span>Works with Android and Apple",
        "pf_b2e8989f_value": "All products are backed by our 30 Day Money Back Guarantee, starting on the day of shipping.\n\n",
        "pf_be36ff83_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(1, 164, 239);\">✓</span>&nbsp;Keeps Your Files Safe",
        "pf_75780ba2_value": "Eliminate the headaches of searching, organizing, transferring and saving photos and videos.",
        "pf_82a1c0a8_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(1, 164, 239);\">✓</span>&nbsp;Backs Up Files Fast\r",
        "pf_dddc7222_label": "Will I have to pay any additional customs, duties or VAT fees when I receive my order?",
        "pf_50e91082_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(1, 164, 239);\">✓</span> Super Easy To Use",
        "pf_34da6d1d_label": "What photo file size is used when we say the 128GB version can store 60,000 photos?",
        "pf_4db697a9_value": "Plug the USB stick into your computer and safely transfer your photos and videos",
        "pf_dccc4a95_value": "Let ThePhotoStick Mobile's custom designed file-backup app do the work for you!\n",
